    {
      "shloka_number": 2,
      "full_sanskrit": "अच्युतं केशवं सत्यभामाधवं माधवं श्रीधरं राधिकाराधितम् ।\nइन्दिरामन्दिरं चेतसा सुन्दरं देवकीनन्दनं नन्दजं सन्दधे ॥२॥",
      "sandhi_split_sanskrit": "अच्युतं केशवं सत्यभामाधवं माधवं श्रीधरं राधिकाराधितम् । | इन्दिरामन्दिरं चेतसा सुन्दरं देवकीनन्दनं नन्दजं सन्दधे ॥२॥",
      "iast_transliteration": "acyutaṃ keśavaṃ satyabhāmādhavaṃ mādhavaṃ śrīdharaṃ rādhikārādhitam |\nindirāmandiraṃ cetasā sundaraṃ devakīnandanaṃ nandajaṃ sandadhe ||2||",
      "meaning_english": "I Worship You O Acyuta, O Keshava, O Lord of Satyabhama. I Worship You O Madhava, O Sridhara, O One Worshipped by Radhika. I Worship You O Temple of Indira, O Beautiful One, O Son of Devaki, O Son of Nanda.",
