    {
      "shloka_number": 3,
      "full_sanskrit": "विष्णवे जिष्णवे शङ्खिने चक्रिणे रुक्मिणीरागिणे जानकीजानये ।\nबल्लवीवल्लभायार्चितायात्मने कंसविध्वंसिने वंशिने ते नमः ॥३॥",
      "sandhi_split_sanskrit": "विष्णवे जिष्णवे शङ्खिने चक्रिणे रुक्मिणीरागिणे जानकीजानये । | बल्लवीवल्लभाय अर्चिताय आत्मने कंसविध्वंसिने वंशिने ते नमः ॥३॥",
      "iast_transliteration": "viṣṇave jiṣṇave śaṅkhine cakriṇe rukmiṇīrāgiṇe jānakījānaye |\nballavīvallabhāyārcitāyātmane kaṃsavidhvaṃsine vaṃśine te namaḥ ||3||",
      "meaning_english": "Salutations to You O Vishnu, O Victorious One, O Holder of the Conch and Discus, O Lover of Rukmini, O Lord of Janaki. Salutations to You O Beloved of the cowherd girls, O the Supreme Soul worshipped by all, O Destroyer of Kamsa, O Flute Player.",
